  "label": "Harmful",
  "description": "The meme trivializes the child's situation by framing his effort as a humorous 'find' rather than acknowledging the physical hardship or poverty implied by the setting. The humor is derived from the contrast between the child's earnestness and the absurdity of the 'find,' which could be seen as insensitive if viewers are not aware of the context of the child's life. The meme relies on the visual of a child in a rugged environment carrying an animal, which may evoke sympathy or concern, but the text turns it into a joke, potentially minimizing the real-life struggles of the child and their family.",
